107	  Add `expectBookingRulesHold(pool: Pool): Promise<void>` to `src/server/test-db.ts`. Task 8 reuses it. It asserts three things:
108	  - no active duplicate `(mentor_id, starts_at)`: `group by … having count(*) > 1` returns no rows;
109	  - no `(mentor_id, mentor_local_date)` with more than 2 active bookings;
110	  - every booking passes `worksAt(mentor, starts_at)`, and its `mentor_local_date` equals `localDate(starts_at, mentor.timeZone)`. Mentors come from `loadMentors`.
111	
112	- [ ] **Step 2: Run them and see them fail**
